Data sources

Pub Tracker queries these public services directly from the user's browser.
Their data is not redistributed by this project; each service's own terms
apply to what it returns.

OpenAlex - https://openalex.org (data released under CC0)
Semantic Scholar Academic Graph API - https://www.semanticscholar.org/product/api
NCBI E-utilities (PubMed) - https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK25497/
ORCID Public API - https://info.orcid.org/documentation/features/public-api/
